.settings/*
# 例外：这一个文件是构建输入，不是 IDE 的个人偏好。它只有六行，装着
# PLC_LD_SCRIPT 的工程默认值（= bootloader 那份链接脚本），一行机器相关的
# 东西都没有。2026-09-10 实测：把它移走之后 bootloader 编不出来 ——
# ${PLC_LD_SCRIPT} 展开成空，链接器拿不到 -T，报的是 ld 错误，离真正的
# 原因隔着好几层。见 docs/design/CUBEMX-RULES.md。
!.settings/org.eclipse.cdt.core.prefs
.vscode/
Debug/
.idea/

# .claude/settings.json IS committed -- it is the shared, machine-independent
# permission allowlist. Only the local override is private. Listing it here
# rather than relying on a global gitignore, which a new machine will not have.
# The trailing * also covers the .bak that init_machine.py keeps of the
# first version it ever replaced.
.claude/settings.local.json*

# Secrets produced by IAPServer/keys/rotate_keys.sh. The backups hold the
# private key and the password in the clear.
IAPServer/keys/fw_signing_key.pem
IAPServer/keys/backup/
*.bak

# Python bytecode from tools/. Committed once by accident on 2026-08-21.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
